              "# China is reportedly on the brink of 'major retaliative measures' against the US as the trade war escalates further\n- China will hit the US with \"major retaliative measures\" at any moment, in reaction to the blacklisting of Huawei, a Chinese state media editor has warned.\n- Hu Xijin, editor of the Global Times, tweeted on Friday: \"China will take major retaliative measures against the US placing Huawei and other Chinese companies on Entity List.\"",
